RadPanel
========

RadPanel is a rebranded fork of the 3x-ui project.

  Upstream:  https://github.com/MHSanaei/3x-ui
  Upstream author / copyright:  MHSanaei and 3x-ui contributors
  Upstream licence:  GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)

This fork is distributed under the same licence, GPL-3.0. See LICENSE.

Changes made in this fork relative to upstream:
  * Renamed the product from "3x-ui" to "RadPanel" (display strings, binary,
    systemd unit, install paths, database filename, env-var prefixes).
  * Repointed the module path / repo slug to this fork.
  * Restyled the web UI (brand accent colour, theme tokens, manifest).
  * Installer and updater scripts retargeted to this fork's releases.

No upstream source files were relicensed. All original copyright notices are
retained. Because this is a GPL-3.0 work, anyone who redistributes RadPanel (or a
modified version of it) must also release the complete corresponding source
under GPL-3.0 and keep these notices intact.

RadPanel is NOT affiliated with or endorsed by the upstream author.
